sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as user
    participant H as harness
    participant M as model api
    participant T as tools
    participant S as durable state
    loop each requested action until done or stopped
        H->>H: validate arguments and evaluate policy
        opt human approval required
            H->>S: record exact proposed action and pending approval
            H->>U: request approval
            U-->>H: approve or decline
            H->>S: record decision
        end
        alt action authorized
            H->>S: record pending operation and stable action id
            H->>T: execute authorized operation
            Note over T: authenticate external calls and enforce execution boundaries
            T-->>H: contents, command output, or action result
            H->>S: record outcome and needed workspace checkpoint
        else action denied
            H->>S: record denial
        end
        H->>H: append observation and manage context size
        H->>M: send updated context
        M-->>H: next tool requests or final response
    end
    H->>H: evaluate completion evidence
    H->>S: save final session and job outcome
    H-->>U: return diff, test results, and pr status

